        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And when he came, lo, Eli sat upon a seat by the wayside watching: for his heart trembled for the ark of God. And when the man came into the city, and told it, all the city cried out.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
